⍝ ==== s2 lexer (spec §1, §2): source code points → token buffer
⍝ The token buffer is one array of ℤ after a sentinel. Slots 0 … 5 are the
⍝ scanner's registers: token count (breaths included), carried marks lo and
⍝ hi, reading index k, chunk start k0 (−1: none), line done. Records follow:
⍝ kind line col marks idx v1 v2 n, then the n code points of the text.
⍝ After the text come rn and the token's raw text as written (marks included,
⍝ in physical order), which the check pass shows in its traces.
⍝ Kinds: 1 name 2 tname 3 anti 4 inverse 5 int 6 real 7 trit 8 glyph
⍝ 9 type 10 tprefix 11 bracket 12 string, and the addenda's 13 curse ⸸…, 14 exorcism ⛨…
⍝ (or the rite prefix ⛨), 15 blessing ✧ ✧✧, 16 vow ⍤⥀ ⍤ᚠ, 17 forbidden binding ⎔⸸ᵘ (v1: the curse
⍝ mask, the blessing's level, or 0 for a loop vow and 1 for a function's). idx −9 is none, −1 is ⁻, −2 is ⁺.
⍝ int: v1 value; real: v1/v2; type and tprefix: v1 prefix length, v2 slot of ⁽ or −1.

⎔ »tixe« ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹exit› ⸫

⍝ ‹ok› a: a, or the enclosing function fails
⦃ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ok› ⸫

⍝ ‹not› t: yes ↔ no
⦃ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⟨ŧ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹not› ⸫
⦃ ⍿¹ ⍿¹ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹min› ⸫
⦃ ⍿¹ ⍿¹ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹max› ⸫

⍝ ‹set› a j v: a with slot j set to v
⦃ ⧖:a,j,v ⧗:a̵ ⟗ ⍴̱ ⧖:len ⟖ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:len △ ≫ ⊟ ⧗:v ⍈̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ↯ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹set› ⸫

⍝ ‹count1› a: one more token
⦃ ⟗ ○ ᚳ ⧖:c ○ ⧗:c △ ⊞ ‹set› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹count1› ⸫
⍝ ‹kstep› a: the next reading index
⦃ ⟗ #3# ᚳ ⧖:k #3# ⧗:k △ ⊞ ‹set› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹kstep› ⸫

⍝ ‹errat› path line col: "path:line:col: error: " (for a plane cell, its file and coordinates, A.1.2)
⦃
  ⧖:path,line,col
  ⧗:patẖ ⧗:line ⧗:line ‹isplane› ⋔ ⦃ ‹plf› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ‹ppath›
  $:$ ⎙̵ ⧗:line,col ‹plpos› $: error: $ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹errat› ⸫

⍝ ---- printing

⍝ ‹ptext› a j n: print slots j … j+n−1 of a
⦃
  ⧖:a,j,n
  ⧗:a̱,j ⧗:j ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,j,end
    ⧗:a̱,j,end ⧗:j,end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:a,j,end ⧗:a̱,j ᚳ ᚢ ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹ptext› ⸫

⍝ ‹pesc› cp: one code point inside a quoted string
⦃
  ⍿⁰ #92# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $\\$ ⎙̵ ⦄
  ⦃ ⍿⁰ #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $\$ ⎙̵ $n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
    ⦃ ⍿⁰ #34# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $\"$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ᚢ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pesc› ⸫

⍝ ‹pquoted› a j n: slots j … j+n−1 as a quoted string
⦃
  ⧖:a,j,n
  $"$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:a̱,j ⧗:j ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,j,end
    ⧗:a̱,j,end ⧗:j,end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:a,j,end ⧗:a̱,j ᚳ ‹pesc› ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
  $"$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pquoted› ⸫

⍝ ‹pkind› k: the name of token kind k
⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $name$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $tname$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $anti$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $inverse$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $int$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $real$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $trit$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $glyph$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $type$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $tprefix$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $bracket$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $string$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #13# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $curse$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #14# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $exorcism$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #15# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $blessing$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #16# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $vow$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #17# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $forbidden$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pkind› ⸫

⍝ ‹flav› cp: charge flavour 1 … 6 (u d s c b t), or 0
⦃
  ⧖:c ○
  ⧗:c #7512# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c #7496# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c #738# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c #7580# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #4# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c #7495# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #5# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c #7511# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #6# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹flav› ⸫

⍝ ‹pflavi› f: the letter of flavour f
⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $u$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $d$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $s$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $c$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $b$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $t$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pflavi› ⸫

⍝ ‹chparse› b i to: one charge factor at slot i: the next slot, its flavour,
⍝ its sign, its exponent digits and whether there were any (1) or not (0)
⦃
  ⧖:b,i,to
  ⧗:ḇ,i ᚳ ‹flav› ⧖:f
  ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧖:i
  ⧗:ḇ,i ᚳ #8315# ᛖ ⧗:i ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎ ⧖:neg
  ⧗:i ⧗:neg ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:i
  ⧗:neg ⋔ ⦃ #-1# ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:sgn
  ⧗:ḇ,i,to ○ ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [b i to e have]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,i,to,e,have
    ⧗:ḇ,i ᚳ ᛥ ⧖:d
    ⧗:ḇ,i,to,e,have,d
    ⧗:d ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:i ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:b,i,to,e,have,d ⧗:ḇ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:to ⧗:e #10# ⊠ ⧗:d ⊞ △ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,i,to,e,have
  ⧗:i,f,sgn,e,have
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹chparse› ⸫

⍝ ‹pcharge› a from to: a charge as "u·d^-1"
⦃
  ⧖:a,from,to
  ⧗:a̱,from,from,to
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,i,from,to
    ⧗:i ⧗:from ≶ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ $·$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅
    ⧗:a̱,i,to ‹chparse› ⧖:i2,f,sgn,e,have
    ⧗:f ‹pflavi›
    ⧗:sgn ⧗:e ⧗:have △ ᛖ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ⁼ ⊠ ⧖:ee
    ⧗:ee ⧗:ee △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ $^$ ⎙̵ ᛁ ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:a̱,i2,from,to
    ⧗:i2 ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pcharge› ⸫

⍝ ‹pprefix› a t np: type prefixes separated by commas (ψ keeps its subscript)
⦃
  ⧖:a,t,np
  ⧗:a̱,t,t ⧗:t ⧗:np ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,i,t,end
    ⧗:a̱,i ᚳ ⧖:c
    ⧗:i ⧗:t ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:c #8320# #8329# ᛦ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ $,$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧗:c ᚢ
    ⧗:a̱ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:t,end
    ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pprefix› ⸫

⍝ ‹pbase› a t np copen n: " base=…" and " charge=…"
⦃
  ⧖:a,t,np,copen,n
  $ base=$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:t ⧗:np ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:copen ⧗:copen ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⧗:np ⊟ ‹ptext›
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:t ⧗:copen ⊞ △ ⊞ ⧗:t ⧗:n ⊞ △ ⊟
  ⧗:copen ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ $ charge=$ ⎙̵ ‹pcharge› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pbase› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptype› a t kind np copen n: the type fields of a record
⦃
  ⧖:a,t,kind,np,copen,n
  ⧗:a̱,t,np
  ⧗:kind #9# ᛖ ⧗:kind #10# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:np ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎
  ⋔ ⦃ $ prefixes=$ ⎙̵ ‹pprefix› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:a̱,t,np,copen,n ⧗:kind #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pbase› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹ptype› ⸫

⍝ ‹pidx› idx
⦃
  ⧖:i
  ⧗:i #-9# ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ $ idx=$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:i
  ⍿⁰ #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $-$ ⎙̵ ⦄
  ⦃ ⍿⁰ #-2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $+$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⍿⁰ #-9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ᛁ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pidx› ⸫

⍝ ‹pvalue› kind v1 v2
⦃
  ⧖:kind,v1,v2
  ⧗:kind #5# ᛖ ⧗:kind #6# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ $ value=$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:v1 ⧗:kind #5# ᛖ ⧗:kind #6# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ᛁ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:v2 ⧗:kind #6# ᛖ ⧗:v2 △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ $/$ ⎙̵ ᛁ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pvalue› ⸫

⍝ ‹prec› a j: print the record at slot j, giving the slot after it
⦃
  ⧖:a,j
  ⧗:a̱,j ᚳ ⧖:kind
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:line
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #2# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:col
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #3# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:marks
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #4# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:idx
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #5# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:v1
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #6# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:v2
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n
  ⧗:line,col ‹plpos› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:kind ‹pkind› $ $ ⎙̵
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:kind #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pquoted› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ptext› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:idx ‹pidx›
  ⧗:kind,v1,v2 ‹pvalue›
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #8# ⊞ ⧗:kind,v1,v2,n ‹ptype›
  ⧗:marks ᛗᛈ
  $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:j #9# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ⧗:a̱ ⧗:j #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ᚳ ⊞
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹prec› ⸫

⍝ ‹dump› a: every record, one per line
⦃
  ⧖:a
  ⧗:a̱ ⧗:a̱ ᚴ #6# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⦃ ‹dump1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹dump› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:a
  ⧗:a̱ #6#
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:a,j ⧗:a̱ ⧗:a̱,j ‹prec› ⍿⁰ ⧗:a̱ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹dump1› ⸫

⍝ ---- arrays of code points (b is a shadow, slots from 0)

⍝ ‹incls› cp cls: cp is in class cls (1 Runic, 2 Ogham, 3 superscript digit, 4 trit digit)
⦃
  ⧖:cp,cls
  ⧗:cp ⧗:cls △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ᚱ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:cp ⧗:cls #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ᚩ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⋏
  ⧗:cp ⧗:cls #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ᛥ ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⋏
  ⧗:cp ⧗:cls #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ᛏ #9# ᛖ ‹not› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⋏
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹incls› ⸫

⍝ ‹allcls› b from to cls: from < to and slots from … to−1 are all in cls
⦃
  ⧖:b,from,to,cls
  ⧗:ḇ,from,to,cls ⧗:from ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹allcls1› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹allcls› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:b,from,to,cls
  ⧗:ḇ,from,to,cls ⦶
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,i,to,cls,acc
    ⧗:ḇ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:to,cls
    ⧗:acc ⧗:ḇ,i ᚳ ⧗:cls ‹incls› ⋎
    ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,i,to,cls,acc ⧗:acc
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹allcls1› ⸫

⍝ ‹findcp› b from cp: the first slot ≥ from holding cp, or the length
⦃
  ⧖:b,from,cp
  ⧗:ḇ,from,cp
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,i,cp
    ⧗:ḇ,i,cp
    ⧗:ḇ,i ᚳ ⧗:cp ᛖ ⧗:i ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋏
    ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:c △ ⊞ ⧗:c ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:r ⌁̱ ⧗:r
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹findcp› ⸫

⍝ ‹skipm› cps lo hi: the first index in lo … hi that is not a mark, or hi+1
⦃
  ⧖:cps,lo,hi
  ⧗:cps̱,hi,lo
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:cps,hi,i
    ⧗:cps̱,hi,i
    ⧗:i ⧗:hi ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:cps̱,i ᚳ ᛗ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:r ⌁ ⌁̱ ⧗:r
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹skipm› ⸫

⍝ ‹bases› cps lo hi: the code points of lo … hi that are not marks, after a sentinel
⦃
  ⧖:cps,lo,hi
  ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⧗:cps̱,lo,hi
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,cps,i,hi
    ⧗:a̵ ⧗:cps̱,i ᚳ ⍿⁰ ᛗ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⍆̵ ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:hi
    ⧗:i ⧗:hi ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹bases› ⸫

⍝ ‹copy› b out from n: out with slots from … from+n−1 of b appended (n ≥ 1)
⦃
  ⧖:b,out,from,n
  ⧗:ḇ,out̵,from ⧗:from ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,out,j,end
    ⧗:ḇ ⧗:out̵ ⧗:ḇ,j ᚳ ⍆̵ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end
    ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:out ⌁̱ ⧗:out̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹copy› ⸫

⍝ ---- numerals (§2): balanced ternary, least-significant trit first

⍝ ‹btval› b from to: the value of the trit digits from … to−1 (not empty)
⦃
  ⧖:b,from,to
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:to △ ⊟ ⧗:from ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [b j from v], j going down
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,j,from,v
    ⧗:ḇ ⧗:j △ ⊟ ⧗:from ⧗:v #3# ⊠ ⧗:ḇ,j ᚳ ᛏ ⊞
    ⧗:j ⧗:from ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,j,from,v ⧗:v
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹btval› ⸫

⍝ ‹msdval› b from to: the trit digits read most-significant first (not empty)
⦃
  ⧖:b,from,to
  ⧗:ḇ,from,to ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,j,to,v
    ⧗:ḇ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:to ⧗:v #3# ⊠ ⧗:ḇ,j ᚳ ᛏ ⊞
    ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,j,to,v ⧗:v
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹msdval› ⸫

⍝ ‹pow3› k
⦃
  △ ⍿¹
  ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:p,k ⧗:p,k ⧗:k ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:p,k ⧗:p #3# ⊠ ⧗:k △ ⊟ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:p ⌁ ⧗:p
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹pow3› ⸫

⍝ ‹reduce› num den: divide both by 3 while they can
⦃
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:num,den
    ⧗:num,den
    ⧗:den △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:num #3# ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ○ ᛖ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:a,c ⧗:a #3# ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧗:c #3# ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹reduce› ⸫

⍝ classification results: kind idx v1 v2 skip len; kind 0 is an error whose
⍝ code is idx and argument v1; kind −1 means "not of this shape"

⍝ ‹real› b n q: the real numeral b with ⁝ at q
⦃
  ⧖:b,n,q
  ⧗:n ⧗:q ⊟ △ ⊟ ‹pow3› ⧖:den
  ⧗:ḇ ○ ⧗:q ‹btval› ⧗:den ⊠ ⧗:ḇ ⧗:q △ ⊞ ⧗:n ‹msdval› ⊞ ⧗:den ‹reduce› ⧖:num2,den2
  #6# #-9# ⧗:num2,den2 ○ ⧗:n
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹real› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b,n,q,q2
  ⧗:ḇ,n ⧗:ḇ ○ ⧗:n #4# ‹allcls›
  ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:b,n #5# #-9# ⧗:ḇ ○ ⧗:n ‹btval› ○ ○ ⧗:n ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ #3# ○ ○ ○ ○ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹numint› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b,n,q,q2
  ⧗:ḇ,n,q
  ⧗:q2 ⧗:n ᛖ ⧗:ḇ ○ ⧗:q #4# ‹allcls› ⋎ ⧗:ḇ ⧗:q △ ⊞ ⧗:n #4# ‹allcls› ⋎
  ⋔ ⦃ ‹real› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ #4# ○ ○ ○ ○ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹numreal› ⸫

⍝ ‹numeral› b: an int or a real
⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ⧖:n
  ⧗:ḇ ○ #8285# ‹findcp› ⧖:q
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:q △ ⊞ ⧗:n ‹min› #8285# ‹findcp› ⧖:q2
  ⧗:ḇ,n,q,q2
  ⧗:q ⧗:n ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹numint› ⦄ ⦃ ‹numreal› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹numeral› ⸫

⍝ ---- charges and types (§3)

⍝ ‹chk1› b from to: check a non-empty charge; error code and argument (0 0 if fine)
⦃
  ⧖:b,from,to
  ⧗:ḇ,from,to ○ ○ ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [b i to seen code arg]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,i,to,seen,code,arg
    ⧗:ḇ,i ᚳ ⧖:c
    ⧗:ḇ,i,to ‹chparse› ⧖:i2,f,sgn,e,have
    ⧗:seen △ ⧗:f ≪ ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⧖:dup
    ○
    ⧗:have △ ᛖ ⧗:e ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #9# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧗:dup ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #8# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧗:f ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #7# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
    ⧖:gc
    ⧗:ḇ,i2,to ⧗:seen △ ⧗:f ≪ ⋓ ⧗:gc ⧗:c
    ⧗:gc ○ ᛖ ⧗:i2 ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,i,to,seen,code,arg ⧗:code,arg
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹chk1› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b,from,to
  ⧗:ḇ,from,to ⧗:from ⧗:to ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ #6# ○ ⦄ ⦃ ‹chk1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹chkcharge› ⸫

⍝ ‹tyres› r np copen n: the result for a type (r 9), a tprefix (10),
⍝ not a type (−1) or error r
⦃
  ⧖:r,np,copen,n
  ⧗:r #9# ᛖ ⧗:r #10# ᛖ ⋏ ⧖:isty
  ⧗:r ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ⧗:isty ⋏ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:r ⧗:isty ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-9# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⍿⁰ #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:np ⧗:isty ⋔ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:copen ⧗:isty ⋔ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⁼
  ○
  ⧗:n ⧗:isty ⋔ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹tyres› ⸫

⍝ ‹psi› b k end: ψ at k with its subscript bound: the next slot and an error code
⦃
  ⧖:b,k,end
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:k △ ⊞ ⧗:end ○ ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [b j end bound cnt]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,j,end,bound,cnt
    ⧗:ḇ,j ᚳ ⧖:c
    ⧗:ḇ,j,end,bound,cnt,c
    ⧗:c #8320# #8329# ᛦ ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:b,j,end,bound,cnt,c ⧗:ḇ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⧗:bound #10# ⊠ ⧗:c #8320# ⊟ ⊞ ⧗:cnt △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,j,end,bound,cnt
  ⧗:j ○
  ⧗:bound #27# ≶ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ #12# ⦄ ∅
  ⧗:bound ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #11# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:cnt ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #10# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹psi› ⸫

⍝ ‹prefix1› b k end: one type prefix at k: the next slot (k when there is none) and an error code
⦃
  ⧖:b,k,end
  ⧗:ḇ,k ᚳ ⧖:c
  ⧗:k ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧖:inr
  ⧗:k ○
  ⧗:inr ⧗:c ⧖ @any(9676,10199,10198,11822,8278)@ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⊞ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:ḇ,k,end ⧗:inr ⧗:c #968# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹psi› ⧖:x,y ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:x,y ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹prefix1› ⸫

⍝ ‹tyempty› b k end copen: only prefixes
⦃
  ⧖:b,k,end,copen
  ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ⧖:n
  ○
  ⧗:n △ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #10# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:n △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:copen ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #13# ⦄ ⁼ ∅
  ⧖:r
  ⧗:r,k,copen,n ‹tyres›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹tyempty› ⸫

⍝ ‹ttype5› b k end copen: prefixes, then a base type or an Ogham type name
⦃
  ⧖:b,k,end,copen
  ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ⧖:n
  ○
  ⧗:end ⧗:k ⊟ △ ᛖ ⧗:ḇ,k ᚳ ⧖ @any(359,8484,8477,120121,643,945,946,947,948,949,950,951,952,961,963)@ ⋎ ⧗:ḇ,k,end #2# ‹allcls› ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #9# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧖:r0
  ⍝ not a type: malformed when there were prefixes or a charge
  ⧗:r0
  ⧗:r0 ○ ᛖ ⧗:k ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:copen ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋏ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #14# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧖:r
  ⧗:r,k,copen,n ‹tyres›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ttype5› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b,k,end,copen
  ⧗:ḇ,k,end,copen
  ⧗:k ⧗:end ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tyempty› ⦄ ⦃ ‹ttype5› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ttype4› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b,k,end,copen,code
  ⧗:ḇ,k,end,copen,code
  ⧗:code ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹ttype4› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:code ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ ⧗:code ○ ○ ○ ○ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ttype3› ⸫

⍝ ‹ttype2› b end copen: the prefixes, then the rest
⦃
  ⧖:b,end,copen
  ⧗:ḇ ○ ⧗:end ○
  ⍝ the loop carries [b k end code]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,k,end,code
    ⧗:ḇ,k,end ‹prefix1› ⧖:k2,code2
    ⧗:ḇ,k2,end,code2
    ⧗:code2 ○ ᛖ ⧗:k2 ⧗:k ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:k2 ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,k,end,code
  ⧗:ḇ,k,end,copen,code ‹ttype3›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ttype2› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b,n,open
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:open △ ⊞ ⧗:n △ ⊟ ‹chkcharge› ⧖:code,arg
  ⧗:ḇ,open,open,code,arg
  ⧗:code ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ‹ttype2› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:code,arg ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ ⧗:code,arg ○ ○ ○ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹tycharge1› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b,n,open
  ⧗:ḇ,n,open ⧗:open ⧗:n ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ○ #5# ○ ○ ○ ○ ⦄ ⦃ ‹tycharge1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹tycharge› ⸫

⍝ ‹ttype› b: a type, a tprefix, not a type, or an error
⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ⧖:n
  ⧗:ḇ ○ #8317# ‹findcp› ⧖:open
  ⧗:ḇ,n,open
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:n △ ⊟ ᚳ #8318# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tycharge› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ‹ttype2› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹ttype› ⸫

⍝ ---- classification of the base characters of a chunk

⦃ ⧖:b,kind ⧗:kind #-9# ○ ○ ○ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rsimple› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:b,kind ⧗:kind #-9# ○ ○ △ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ △ ⊟ ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rtail› ⸫

⍝ ‹asciicode› c: 1 for an ASCII letter, 2 for an ASCII digit, else 0
⦃ ⧖:c ○ ⧗:c ᛰ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:c ᚪ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹asciicode› ⸫

⍝ ‹ascii› b: the code of the first ASCII letter or digit
⦃
  ⧖:b ⧗:ḇ ○ ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,i,code
    ⧗:ḇ ⧗:i △ ⊞
    ⧗:code ⧗:ḇ,i ᚳ ‹asciicode› ⧗:code ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:v ⌁ ⧗:v ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:code ⌁ ⌁̱ ⧗:code
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ascii› ⸫

⍝ ‹supval› b from to: superscript digits as a decimal number
⦃
  ⧖:b,from,to
  ⧗:ḇ,from,to ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,j,to,v
    ⧗:ḇ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:to ⧗:v #10# ⊠ ⧗:ḇ,j ᚳ ᛥ ⊞
    ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,j,to,v ⧗:v
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹supval› ⸫

⍝ ‹index› b: a glyph with a superscript index
⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ⧖:n
  #-9#
  ⧗:ḇ ○ ᚳ #8857# ᛖ ⧗:n #2# ᛖ ⋎ ⧖:dot
  ⧗:dot ⧗:ḇ △ ᚳ #8315# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:dot ⧗:ḇ △ ᚳ #8314# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:ḇ
  ⧗:ḇ △ ⧗:n #3# ‹allcls› ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:b ⌁ ⧗:ḇ △ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ‹supval› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧖:idx
  ⧗:idx ⧗:idx #-9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ #15# ○ ○ ○ ○ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:x #8# ⧗:x ○ ○ ○ △ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹index› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ △ ᛖ ⧗:ḇ ○ ᚳ ᚷ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ #8# ‹rsimple› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̱ ○ #16# ○ ○ ○ ○ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹cl10› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ‹ttype› ⧖:k,i,v1,v2,s,l
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:k,i,v1,v2,s,l
  ⧗:k #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ‹cl10› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:k,i,v1,v2,s,l ⌁̱ ⧗:k,i,v1,v2,s,l ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹cl9› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:ḇ ○ ᚳ ᛃ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹index› ⦄ ⦃ ‹cl9› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹cl8› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ #2# ᛖ ⧗:ḇ ○ ᚳ #8916# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:ḇ △ ᚳ #8651# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ #8# ‹rsimple› ⦄ ⦃ ‹cl8› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹cl7› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ △ ᛖ ⧗:ḇ ○ ᚳ ᛇ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ #7# ‹rsimple› ⦄ ⦃ ‹cl7› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹cl6› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:ḇ ○ ᚳ ᛏ #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹cl6› ⦄ ⦃ ‹numeral› ⦄ ⁼
