⍝ ---- the addenda's tokens (A.4, A.5): ⸸… curses, ⛨… exorcisms and the rite prefix ⛨,
⍝ ✧ ✧✧ blessings, ⍤⥀ ⍤ᚠ vows and ⎔⸸ᵘ forbidden bindings

⍝ ‹cursebit› cp: the bit of a curse letter (ᶠ 1, ⁱ 2, ᵘ 4, ᵈ 8, ᵃ 16), or 0
⦃
  ⧖:c ○
  ⧗:c #7584# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:c #8305# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:c #7512# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #4# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c #7496# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #8# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:c #7491# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #16# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹cursebit› ⸫

⍝ ‹cursemask› b from: the mask of the curse letters from slot from on (−1 if one is not a
⍝ curse letter, repeats, or there are none)
⦃
  ⧖:b,from
  ⧗:ḇ,from ⧗:from ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ #-1# ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ○ ⦄
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:b,i,m
    ⧗:ḇ,i ᚳ ‹cursebit› ⧖:bit
    ⧗:ḇ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:m ⧗:bit ⧗:bit ○ ᛖ ⧗:m ⧗:bit ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋏ ⧗:m #-1# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⦃ ⋓ ⦄ ⁼
    ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:b,i,m ⧗:m
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹cursemask› ⸫

⍝ ‹cladd› b: one of the addenda's tokens, or the ordinary classification
⦃
  ⧖:b
  ⧗:ḇ ᚴ ⧖:n ⧗:ḇ ○ ᚳ ⧖:c0 ⧗:ḇ △ ᚳ ⧖:c1
  ⧗:ḇ △ ‹cursemask› ⧖:m1
  ○
  ⧗:c0 #11832# ᛖ ⧗:m1 #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:n △ ᛖ ⋏ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #13# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c0 #9960# ᛖ ⧗:n △ ᛖ ⧗:m1 #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋏ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #14# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c0 #10023# ᛖ ⧗:n △ ᛖ ⧗:n #2# ᛖ ⧗:c1 #10023# ᛖ ⋎ ⋏ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #15# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c0 #9060# ᛖ ⧗:n #2# ᛖ ⧗:c1 #10560# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:ḇ △ ⧗:n △ ‹allcls› ⋏ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #16# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c0 #9108# ᛖ ⧗:n #3# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:c1 #11832# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:ḇ #2# ᚳ #7512# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #17# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧖:kind
  ⍝ v1: the curse mask (13, 14; 0 for a bare ⛨), the blessing's level, 0 for ⍤⥀ and 1 for ⍤ᚠ, 4 for ⎔⸸ᵘ
  ○ ⧗:m1 ⧗:n △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:t1
  ⧗:n ⧗:t1 ⧗:kind #15# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:t2
  ○ △ ⧗:c1 #10560# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:t2 ⧗:kind #16# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:t3
  #4# ⧗:t3 ⧗:kind #17# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:v1
  ⧗:ḇ,kind,v1,n ⧗:kind ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ‹cl1› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:k,v,nn ⌁̱ ⧗:k #-9# ⧗:v ○ ○ ⧗:nn ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹cladd› ⸫

⍝ ---- combining marks (§2.1)

⍝ ‹markinfo› m: bit and class (1 case, 2 tense, 3 agreement); bit 0 if unregistered
⦃
  ⧖:m ○ ○
  ⧗:m #817# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ △ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:m #771# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #2# #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:m #776# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #4# #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:m #821# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #8# #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:m #816# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #16# #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:m #769# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #32# △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:m #768# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #64# △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:m #770# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ #128# △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹markinfo› ⸫

⍝ ‹markok› kind c0 cls: a mark of class cls may attach to this token
⦃
  ⧖:kind,c0,cls
  ⊕
  ⧗:cls △ ᛖ
  ⧗:kind #5# ᛖ ⧗:kind #6# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:kind #7# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:kind #12# ᛖ ⋏
  ⧗:kind #8# ᛖ ⧗:c0 #10711# ᛖ ⧗:c0 #9087# ᛖ ⋏ ⋎
  ⋏ ⋎ ⋏
  ⧗:cls #2# ᛖ ⧗:kind △ ᛖ ⧗:kind #4# ᛖ ⋏ ⋎ ⋏
  ⧗:cls #3# ᛖ ⧗:kind #8# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:c0 #11825# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋏
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹markok› ⸫

⍝ ‹mark2› mask code bit nc nt cp kind c0: one mark
⦃
  ⧖:mask,code,bit,nc,nt,cp,kind,c0
  ⧗:cp ‹markinfo› ⧖:b,cls
  ⍝ 21 unregistered, 22 duplicate, 23 cannot attach
  ○
  ⧗:kind,c0,cls ‹markok› ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #23# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:mask ⧗:b ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #22# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:b ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #21# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧖:c
  ⧗:mask ⧗:b ⋓ ⧗:c ⧗:b
  ⧗:nc ⧗:cls △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:nt ⧗:cls #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹mark2› ⸫

⍝ ‹mark1› cp kind c0 mask code bit nc nt: one code point (not a mark: no change)
⦃
  ⧖:cp,kind,c0,mask,code,bit,nc,nt
  ⧗:mask,code,bit,nc,nt,cp,kind,c0
  ⧗:code ○ ᛖ ⧗:cp ᛗ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹mark2› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹mark1› ⸫

⍝ ‹marks› cps from to kind c0: the marks in from … to: mask, error code, the bit at fault
⦃
  ⧖:cps,from,to,kind,c0
  ⧗:cps̱,from,to,kind,c0 ○ ○ ○ ○ ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:cps,i,to,kind,c0,mask,code,bit,nc,nt
    ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:to,kind,c0
    ⧗:cps̱,i ᚳ ⧗:kind,c0,mask,code,bit,nc,nt ‹mark1›
    ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:cps,i,to,kind,c0,mask,code,bit,nc,nt
  ⧗:mask
  ⧗:code ⧗:code ○ ᛖ ⧗:nc △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #24# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⧗:nt △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #25# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:bit
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹marks› ⸫

⍝ ‹pcls› bit: the class name of a mark bit
⦃
  ⧖:b #3#
  ⧗:b #2# ᛖ ⧗:b #4# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:b #32# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ⁼ ∅
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $case$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $tense$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $agree$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pcls› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:kind,bit
  $mark $ ⎙̵ ⧗:bit ᛗᚾ $ ($ ⎙̵ ⧗:bit ‹pcls› $) cannot attach to $ ⎙̵ ⧗:kind ‹pkind› $ $ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pm23› ⸫

⍝ ‹pmerr› t from n kind code bit: the message of a mark error, about text from … from+n−1
⦃
  ⧖:t,from,n,kind,code,bit
  ⧗:code #21# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $unregistered combining mark on $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:bit ⧗:code #22# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $duplicate mark $ ⎙̵ ᛗᚾ $ on $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:kind,bit ⧗:code #23# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pm23› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:code #24# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $more than one case mark on $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #25# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $more than one tense mark on $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:ṯ,from,n ‹ptext› $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pmerr› ⸫

⍝ ‹pcerr› b code arg: the message of a classification error
⦃
  ⧖:b,code,arg
  ⧗:code △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ASCII letters are illegal outside strings: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ASCII digits are illegal (numerals are ▽ ○ △): $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $malformed numeral: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $malformed real numeral: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $charge is missing ⁽$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $empty charge$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:arg ⧗:code #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $bad charge flavour: $ ⎙̵ ᚢ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:arg ⧗:code #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $flavour repeated in charge: $ ⎙̵ ‹flav› ‹pflavi› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:code #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $zero exponent in charge$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ψ needs a subscript bound, e.g. ψ₂$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ψ₀ cannot hold anything$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #12# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $decoherence cap: ψ holds at most 27 alternatives (§8.3)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #13# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $charge without a type: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #14# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $malformed type: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:code #16# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $unknown token: $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:ḇ ⧗:code #15# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:b $bad index on $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ḇ ○ ᚳ ᚢ $: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ḇ △ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ △ ⊟ ‹ptext› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  ⍝ codes that quote the whole chunk
  ⧗:ḇ ○ ⧗:ḇ ᚴ
  ⧗:code △ #4# ᛦ ⧗:code #13# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:code #14# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:code #16# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ‹ptext› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⁼
  $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pcerr› ⸫

⍝ ---- tokens

⍝ ‹emit1› out bs line col kind idx v1 v2 skip n mask cps fb hi: append a record
⦃
  ⧖:out,bs,line,col,kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n,mask,cps,fb,hi
  ⧗:out̵ ⧗:kind ⍆̵ ⧗:line ⍆̵ ⧗:col ⍆̵ ⧗:mask ⍆̵ ⧗:idx ⍆̵ ⧗:v1 ⍆̵ ⧗:v2 ⍆̵ ⧗:n ⍆̵ ⧖:out
  ⧗:bs̵ ⟗ ⧗:out̵,skip,n ‹copy› ⧖:out ⌁̵
  ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:out̵ ⧗:hi ⧗:fb ⊟ △ ⊞ ⍆̵ ⧗:fb ⧗:hi ⧗:fb ⊟ △ ⊞ ‹copy›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹emit1› ⸫

⍝ ‹emit› out bs path line col kind idx v1 v2 skip n mask cps fb hi: count the token; record it
⍝ unless it is a breath outside a plane (in a plane a breath holds a cell, A.1.2)
⦃
  ⧖:out,bs,path,line,col,kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n,mask,cps,fb,hi
  ⧗:bs̵ ⟗ ⧗:skip ᚳ ⧖:c0 ⧖:bs
  ⧗:out̵ ‹count1› ‹ok›
  ⧗:bs̵,line,col,kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n,mask,cps̱,fb,hi
  ⧗:kind #8# ᛖ ⧗:n △ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:c0 #11825# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:line ‹isplane› ‹not› ⋎
  ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹emit1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹emit› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,bs,path,line,col,kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n,mask,code,bit
  ⧗:patẖ,line,col ‹errat›
  ⧗:bs̵ ⟗ ⧗:skip,n,kind,code,bit ‹pmerr› ⌁̵
  ⧗:out̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹markerr› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,bs,cps,path,line,col,fb,hi,kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n
  ⧗:bs̵ ⟗ ⧗:skip ᚳ ⧖:c0 ⧖:bs
  ⧗:cps̱,fb,hi,kind,c0 ‹marks› ⧖:mask,code,bit
  ⧗:out̵,bs̵,patẖ,line,col,kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n,mask,code,bit,cps̱,fb,hi
  ⧗:code ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:cps2,fb2,hi2 ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:cps2̱,fb2,hi2 ‹emit› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ‹markerr› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tokok› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,bs,cps,path,line,col,fb,hi,kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n
  ⧗:patẖ,line,col ‹errat›
  ⧗:bs̵ ⟗ ⧗:idx,v1 ‹pcerr› ⌁̵
  ⧗:out̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tokerr› ⸫

⍝ ‹token› out cps path line ls le fb hi: the token whose first base is at fb
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le,fb,hi
  ⧗:cps̱,fb,hi ‹bases› ⧖:bs
  ⧗:bs̵ ⟗ ‹classify› ⧖:kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n ⧖:bs
  ⧗:fb ⧗:ls ⊟ △ ⊞ ⧖:col
  ⧗:out̵,bs̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,col,fb,hi,kind,idx,v1,v2,skip,n
  ⧗:kind ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tokerr› ⦄ ⦃ ‹tokok› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹token› ⸫

⍝ ‹lead› out path line ls lo fb isStr: marks before the first base of a chunk
⦃
  ⧖:out,path,line,ls,lo,fb,isStr
  ⧗:out̵,patẖ,line,ls,lo,fb
  ⧗:line △ ⋒ ○ ᛖ ⧗:isStr ⋎
  ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:out,path,line,ls,lo,fb ⧗:out̵ △ ⧗:lo ‹set› #2# ⧗:fb △ ⊟ ‹set› ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:out,path,line,ls,lo,fb ⧗:patẖ,line ⧗:lo ⧗:ls ⊟ △ ⊞ ‹errat› $combining mark with no base character\n$ ⎙̵ ⧗:out̵ ⌁̵ ↯ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹lead› ⸫

⍝ ‹chunk› out cps path line ls le lo hi isStr: the chunk at lo … hi
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le,lo,hi,isStr
  ⧗:cps̱,lo,hi ‹skipm› ⧖:fb
  ⧗:out̵,patẖ,line,ls,lo,fb,isStr
  ⧗:fb ⧗:lo ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⦃ ‹lead› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⦄
  ⧖:out
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le,fb,hi
  ⧗:fb ⧗:hi ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹token› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⦃ ‹token› ‹ok› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹chunk› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le,isStr,k0,k
  ⧗:line,ls,le,k0 ᛈᛟ ⧗:line,ls,le ⧗:k △ ⊟ ᛈᛟ ⧖:pa,pb
  ⧗:pa ⧗:pb ‹min› ⧗:pa ⧗:pb ‹max› ⧖:lo,hi
  ⧗:out̵ #4# #-1# ‹set› ⧗:cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le,lo,hi,isStr ‹chunk›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹flush1› ⸫

⍝ ‹flush› out cps path line ls le isStr: end the current chunk (isStr: a string follows)
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le,isStr
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ #4# ᚳ ⧖:k0 ⟗ #3# ᚳ ⧖:k ⧖:out
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le,isStr,k0,k
  ⧗:k0 #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱ ⦄ ⦃ ‹flush1› ‹ok› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹flush› ⸫

⍝ ---- the characters of a line (out cps path line ls le, then the case)

⦃ ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le ⊕ ‹flush› #5# △ ‹set› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cend› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le ⊕ ‹flush› ‹kstep› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cspace› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ #4# ᚳ ⧖:k0 ⟗ #3# ᚳ ⧖:k ⧖:out
  ⧗:out̵ ⧗:k ⧗:k0 #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:k #4# ⧗:k ‹set› ‹ok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ‹kstep›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cother› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le ⊕ ‹flush› ‹ok›
  ⟗ #3# ᚳ ⧖:k ⧖:out
  ⧗:line,ls,le,k ᛈᛟ ⧖:p
  ⧗:cps̱,p ᚳ ⧗:line ᚹ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ ᛘ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:b
  ⧗:out̵ #11# ⍆̵ ⧗:line ⍆̵ ⧗:p ⧗:ls ⊟ △ ⊞ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ #-9# ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ △ ⍆̵ ⧗:b ⍆̵ △ ⍆̵ ⧗:b ⍆̵
  ‹count1› ‹kstep›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cbracket› ⸫

⍝ ---- strings

⍝ ‹findclose› cps line ls le k: the reading index of the next «, or the line length
⦃
  ⧖:cps,line,ls,le,k
  ⧗:cps̱,line,ls,le,k
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:cps,line,ls,le,k
    ⧗:cps̱,line,ls,le,k
    ⧗:k ⧗:le ⧗:ls ⊟ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:line,ls,le,k ᛈᛟ ᚳ #171# ᛖ ⋏
    ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:cps,line,ls,le,k ⧗:k
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹findclose› ⸫

⍝ ‹cstart› cps j lo: the start of the cluster (base and marks) ending at j
⦃
  ⧖:cps,j,lo
  ⧗:cps̱,j,lo
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:cps,s,lo
    ⧗:cps̱,s,lo
    ⧗:s ⧗:lo ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:cps̱,s ᚳ ᛗ ⋎
    ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:l △ ⊟ ⧗:l ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:s ⌁̱ ⧗:s
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹cstart› ⸫

⍝ ‹appcl› out cps s j: append s … j, with ↵ as a newline
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,s,j
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,s,j
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:out,cps,i,j
    ⧗:out̵ ⧗:cps̱,i ᚳ ⍿⁰ #8629# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #10# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⍆̵
    ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:j
    ⧗:i ⧗:j ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹appcl› ⸫

⍝ ‹decode› out cps a b: the string between delimiters a and b: clusters in reverse
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,a,b
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱ ⧗:b △ ⊟ ⧗:a △ ⊞
  ⍝ the loop carries [out cps j lo]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:out,cps,j,lo
    ⧗:out̵,cps̱,j,lo
    ⧗:j ⧗:lo ≶ ⋔
      ⦃ ⧖:out,cps,j,lo ⧗:cps̱,j,lo ‹cstart› ⧖:s ⧗:out̵ ⧗:cps̱,s,j ‹appcl› ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:s △ ⊟ ⧗:lo ⊕ ⦄
      ⁼
      ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹decode› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,path,line,col,r,mask,code,bit
  ⧗:out̵ ⧗:r #3# ⊞ ⧗:mask ‹set›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹smok› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,path,line,col,r,mask,code,bit
  ⧗:patẖ,line,col ‹errat›
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ ⧗:r #7# ⊞ ᚳ ⧖:n ⧖:out
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ ⧗:r #8# ⊞ ⧗:n #12# ⧗:code,bit ‹pmerr› ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹smerr› ⸫

⍝ ‹smarks› out cps path line r from to col: the marks of the string record at r
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,r,from,to,col
  ⧗:cps̱,from,to #12# ○ ‹marks› ⧖:mask,code,bit
  ⧗:out̵,patẖ,line,col,r,mask,code,bit
  ⧗:code ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹smok› ⦄ ⦃ ‹smerr› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹smarks› ⸫

⍝ ‹chunkc› c: c continues a chunk
⦃ ⧖ ⧗⁰ ᛋ ⧗⁰ #9053# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗⁰ ᚸ ⋏ ⧗⁰ #187# ᛖ ⋏ ‹not› ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹chunkc› ⸫

⍝ ‹copyn› b out from n: ‹copy›, but n may be 0 (or below)
⦃
  ⧖:b,out,from,n
  ⧗:ḇ,out̵,from,n ⧗:n ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:o ⌁̱ ⧗:o̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹copy› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹copyn› ⸫

⍝ ‹sraw› out cps a b mlo mhi: a string's raw text: »content« and the marks mlo … mhi (none if mlo is −1)
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,a,b,mlo,mhi
  ⧗:mhi ⧗:mlo ⊟ △ ⊞ ⧗:mlo #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:nm
  ⧗:b ⧗:a ⊟ △ ⊟ ⧖:nc
  ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:out̵ ⧗:nc ⧗:nm ⊞ #2# ⊞ ⍆̵ #187# ⍆̵ ⧗:a △ ⊞ ⧗:nc ‹copyn› #171# ⍆̵ ⧖:out
  ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:out̵ ⧗:mlo ⧗:nm ‹copyn›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sraw› ⸫

⍝ ‹smodd› …: on an odd line the marks follow «
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le,kc,pc,left,r,right
  ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:pc △ ⊞ ⧗:le △ ⊟ ‹skipm› ⧖:q
  ⍝ errors in these marks point at the chunk that follows them, as in s1
  ⧗:pc △ ⊞ ⧗:ls ⊟ △ ⊞ ⧗:q ⧗:ls ⊟ △ ⊞
  ⧗:q ⧗:le ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:cps̱,q ᚳ ‹chunkc› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:col
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,r ⧗:pc △ ⊞ ⧗:q △ ⊟ ⧗:col ‹smarks›
  ⧗:cps̱,left,right ⧗:pc △ ⊞ ⧗:q △ ⊟ ‹sraw›
  #3# ⧗:kc ⧗:q ⊞ ⧗:pc ⊟ ‹set›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹smodd› ⸫

⍝ ‹smeven› …: on an even line the marks were carried from the chunk before »
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le,kc,pc,left,r,right
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ △ ᚳ ⧖:clo ⟗ #2# ᚳ ⧖:chi ⧖:out
  ⧗:out̵ △ #-1# ‹set› #2# #-1# ‹set› ‹ok›
  ⧗:cps̱,patẖ,line,r,clo,chi ⧗:left ⧗:ls ⊟ △ ⊞ ‹smarks›
  ⧗:cps̱,left,right,clo,chi ‹sraw›
  #3# ⧗:kc △ ⊞ ‹set›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹smeven› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le,k,kc
  ⧗:patẖ,line ⧗:line,ls,le,k ᛈᛟ ⧗:ls ⊟ △ ⊞ ‹errat› $unterminated string\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:out̵ ⌁̵ ↯
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹unterm› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le,k,kc
  ⧗:line,ls,le,k ᛈᛟ ⧖:p0
  ⧗:line,ls,le,kc ᛈᛟ ⧖:pc
  ⧗:p0 ⧗:pc ‹min› ⧖:left
  ⧗:p0 ⧗:pc ‹max› ⧖:right
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ ᚴ ⧖:r ⧖:out
  ⧗:right ⧗:left ⊟ △ ⊟ ⧖:n
  ⧗:out̵ #12# ⍆̵ ⧗:line ⍆̵ ⧗:left ⧗:ls ⊟ △ ⊞ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ #-9# ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ⧗:n ⍆̵
  ⧗:cps̱,left,right ‹decode› ‹count1› ‹ok›
  ⧗:cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le,kc,pc,left,r,right
  ⧗:line ᚹ ⋔ ⦃ ‹smodd› ⦄ ⦃ ‹smeven› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹string› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le ⦶ ‹flush› ‹ok›
  ⟗ #3# ᚳ ⧖:k ⧖:out
  ⧗:cps̱,line,ls,le ⧗:k △ ⊞ ‹findclose› ⧖:kc
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le,k,kc
  ⧗:kc ⧗:le ⧗:ls ⊟ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹unterm› ⦄ ⦃ ‹string› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cstring› ⸫

⍝ ---- lines

⍝ ‹cclass› c: 0 space, 1 comment, 2 bracket, 3 string, 4 anything else
⦃
  ⧖:c #4#
  ⧗:c #187# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c ᚸ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c #9053# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:c ᛋ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹cclass› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ #3# ᚳ ⧖:k ⧖:out
  ⧗:cps̱ ⧗:line,ls,le,k ᛈᛟ ᚳ ‹cclass› ⧖:cl
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le,cl
  ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹cspace› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹cend› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹cbracket› ⦄ ⦃
  #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹cstring› ⦄ ⦃ ‹cother› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹char› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:out̵ ⟗ #3# ᚳ ⧖:k ⧖:out
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le
  ⧗:k ⧗:le ⧗:ls ⊟ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹cend› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹char› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹step› ⸫

⍝ ‹line› out cps path line ls le: the tokens of the line ls … le−1
⦃
  ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
  ⧗:out̵ #3# ○ ‹set› #4# #-1# ‹set› #5# ○ ‹set› ‹ok›
  ⧗:cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:out,cps,path,line,ls,le
    ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le ‹step› ‹ok›
    ⟗ #5# ᚳ ⧖:stop ⧖:out
    ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le
    ⧗:stop ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹line› ⸫

⍝ ‹eol› cps i: the index of the next newline at or after i, or the length
⦃
  ⧖:cps,i
  ⧗:cps̱,i
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:cps,i
    ⧗:cps̱,i ᚳ ⧖:c
    ⧗:cps̱,i
    ⧗:c #10# ᛖ ⧗:c #-1# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁̱ ⧗:i
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹eol› ⸫

⍝ ‹lex› cps path: the token buffer of a whole file
⦃ ⧖:cps,path ⧗:cps̱ ⟦ ○ ○ ▽ ▽ ○ ▽ ○ ⟧ ⧗:patẖ △ ‹lexinto› ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹lex› ⸫

⍝ ‹lexinto› cps out path line0: the tokens of a file appended to out, its first line being
⍝ line0 (a packed plane origin for the files of a module of planes, A.1)
⦃
  ⧖:cps,out,path,line0
  ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ ○ ⧗:line0
  ⍝ the loop carries [out cps path ls line]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:out,cps,path,ls,line
    ⧗:cps̱,ls ‹eol› ⧖:le
    ⧗:out̵,cps̱,patẖ,line,ls,le ‹line2› ‹ok›
    ⧗:cps̱,patẖ ⧗:le △ ⊞ ⧗:cps̱,ls,le,line ‹nextl›
    ⧗:le ⧗:cps̱ ᚴ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹lexinto› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:path,cps ⧗:cps̵ ⟗ ⧗:patẖ ‹lex› ⧖:out ⌁̵ ⧗:out̵ ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹lexw› ⸫
